+
+    /**
+     * @brief Releases a specified reset manager.
+     *
+     * @param resetMgr Indicates the pointer to the reset manager.
+     * @return Returns <b>0</b> if the reset manager is released; returns a negative value otherwise.
+     *
+     * @since 1.0
+     * @version 1.0
